. use "final_data.dta", clear
((null))

. 
. *----------------------------------------------------------------------------
> ---
. * 1. Define the event-time "year"
. *----------------------------------------------------------------------------
> ---
. * SB 826 was signed 30 Sep 2018. Fiscal year 2018 mixes pre and post firms (a
>  June
. * 2018 year-end is pre, a Dec 2018 year-end is post), so 2017 is the referenc
> e year.
. * year = fiscal year (calendar year of the fiscal year end), as in the other 
> scripts
. gen pyear = fyeyear

. label var pyear "Fiscal year (calendar year of fiscal year end)"

. 
. * Settings you can change ---------------------------------------------------
> ----
. local refyr   2017     // omitted (reference) year = last fully pre-law fisca
> l year

. local firstyr 2011

. local lastyr  2020

. * To show only the pre-COVID window instead, use:  keep if mainwindow == 1
. *   (then set lastyr to 2019; note pyear 2020 would hold only Oct-Dec 2019 ye
> ar-ends)
. * To drop the 10 firms that moved out of California (robustness):
. *   drop if mover == 1
. * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
> ---
. 
. keep if pyear >= `firstyr' & pyear <= `lastyr'
(5,979 observations deleted)

. 
. tab pyear ca

    Fiscal |
      year |
 (calendar |      =1 if HQ in
   year of | California on 30 Sep
